### 1. Login as Owner to Central Admin Panel
POST http://localhost/api/central/v1/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{
    "email": "owner@saas.com",
    "password": "password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("central_token", response.body.token);
%}


### 2. Logout from Central Admin Panel
POST http://localhost/api/v1/logout
Accept: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Authorization: Bearer {{central_token}}


### 3. Login as Owner to company_a (Tenant space via shadow copy)
POST http://localhost/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost

{
    "email": "owner@saas.com",
    "password": "password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}


### 4. Login as Manager Sub Account to company_a
POST http://localhost/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost

{
    "email": "manager@companya.com",
    "password": "password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}


### 5. Login as a Viewer Sub Account to company_a
POST http://localhost/api/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost

{
    "email": "viewer@companya.com",
    "password": "password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}


### 6. Logout from company_a
POST http://localhost/api/logout
Accept: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### 7. Test Role Protection company_a
GET http://localhost/api/test-role-protection
Accept: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### 8. Create Invoice company_a
POST http://localhost/api/invoices
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
    "invoice_number": "INV-2026-{{$randomInt}}",
    "customer_name": "Acme Corporation",
    "customer_tax_id": "PL1234567890",
    "net_amount": 1000.00,
    "vat_amount": 230.00,
    "gross_amount": 1230.00,
    "due_date": "2026-10-14"
}

### 9. Get Invoice list company_a
GET http://localhost/api/invoices
Accept: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Host: company_a.localhost
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
